From: Jules <jules@ai>
Date: Sat, 25 May 2024 10:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: Integrate Smartspace

Integrate the reverse-engineered Smartspace implementation.
This patch hooks up the Keyguard Smartspace controllers and provides the necessary Dagger bindings.
Note: This patch assumes the 'com.google.android.systemui.smartspace' package sources are present in the build path.

